OL,3,GNEWSA'I thought diet clubs weren't for
OL,4,Amen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving struggled with his weight for
OL,7,Fmost of his adult life, Mark Hall
OL,8,Fthought he had turned a corner when he
OL,9,Fjoined a local slimming club.
OL,11,FHe had assumed he would be surrounded
OL,12,Fby mostly women, so he was not
OL,13,Fsurprised when he was one of only three
OL,14,Fmen in the group.
OL,16,FWhat did surprise him, though, was how
OL,17,Ffemale-specific the weekly meetings
OL,18,Ffelt. One of his first sessions, he
OL,19,Fsays, focused on the effects of obesity
OL,20,Fon menstrual cycles.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
