OL,3,GNEWSA'I thought diet clubs weren't for
OL,4,Amen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt only took a couple of months for
OL,7,FHall, from Needingworth,
OL,8,FCambridgeshire, to decide the group was
OL,9,Fnot for him and he returned to a
OL,10,Flifelong cycle of losing weight and
OL,11,Fthen putting it back on.
